Kehti Thi Roke Madar Aajou Run Se Asghar<br>
Tum Bin Jeungi Kyun Kar Aajou Run Se Asghar<br>
<br>
1.Khaima Hai Suna Suna Kisku Jhulao Jhula<br>
Aarasta Hai Bistar Aajou Run Se Asghar<br>
<br>
2.Nanhe Gaale Pe Tumne Maqtal Me Teer Khaya<br>
Hai Jakm Mere Dil Par Aajou Run Se Asghar<br>
<br>
3.Jhule Ke Pass Aakar Nazrou Se Dhudhti Hu<br>
Roti Hai Tumku Khahar Aajou Run Se Asghar<br>
<br>
4.Gardan Pe Teer Khakar Kis Tarha Tum Hasse They<br>
Maa Ku Dikhou Haskar Aajou Run Se Asghar
